# Security headers for the Quotely web app on Cloudflare Pages.
#
# The app holds a JWT and displays financial documents, so the cheap browser-side protections are
# worth having. HSTS is not set here: Cloudflare already serves *.pages.dev over HTTPS only, and
# committing to HSTS is a decision for a custom domain, not a platform subdomain.

/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=(), payment=()
